0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnVehicleDeath:0x02:Callback triggered when a vehicle is destroyed
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerText:0x02:Callback triggered when a player sends public chat
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerCommandText:0x02:Callback triggered when a player enters a slash command
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerRequestClass:0x02:Callback triggered when a player views class selection
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerEnterVehicle:0x02:Callback triggered when a player starts entering a vehicle
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerExitVehicle:0x02:Callback triggered when a player starts exiting a vehicle
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerStateChange:0x02:Callback triggered when a player changes state (foot, car, etc.)
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerEnterCheckpoint:0x02:Callback triggered when a player enters standard checkpoint
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerLeaveCheckpoint:0x02:Callback triggered when a player leaves standard checkpoint
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerEnterRaceCheckpoint:0x02:Callback triggered when entering race checkpoint
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerLeaveRaceCheckpoint:0x02:Callback triggered when leaving race checkpoint
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnRconCommand:0x02:Callback triggered on server console RCON command
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerRequestSpawn:0x02:Callback triggered when player clicks Spawn button
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnObjectMoved:0x02:Callback triggered when a moving object finishes its travel
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerObjectMoved:0x02:Callback triggered when player object finishes moving
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerPickUpPickup:0x02:Callback triggered when a player walks over a pickup
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnVehicleMod:0x02:Callback triggered when a vehicle modification is installed
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnVehiclePaintjob:0x02:Callback triggered when a vehicle paintjob is applied
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnVehicleRespray:0x02:Callback triggered when a vehicle color is changed
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnVehicleDamageStatusUpdate:0x02:Callback triggered on vehicle damage parts update
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnUnoccupiedVehicleUpdate:0x02:Callback triggered periodically for unoccupied vehicles
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerSelectedMenuRow:0x02:Callback triggered when selecting a menu option
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerExitedMenu:0x02:Callback triggered when player cancels out of a menu
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnDialogResponse:0x02:Callback triggered when user interacts with a GUI dialog
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerClickPlayerTextDraw:0x02:Callback triggered on clicking personal text draw
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerClickTextDraw:0x02:Callback triggered on clicking global text draw
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerClickPlayer:0x02:Callback triggered when clicking player in scoreboard
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnIncomingConnection:0x02:Callback triggered on incoming raw client connection
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnTrailerUpdate:0x02:Callback triggered when vehicle trailer sync updates
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnVehicleSirenStateChange:0x02:Callback triggered when siren toggles on/off
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerGiveDamage:0x02:Callback triggered when a player damages someone
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerTakeDamage:0x02:Callback triggered when a player suffers damage
0x01:item|CALLBACK|OnPlayerWeaponShot:0x02:Callback triggered on bullet fired by weapon
0x01:item|FUNCTION|print:0x02:Prints a plain string to server log without formatting: print(const string[])
0x01:item|FUNCTION|printf:0x02:Prints formatted string to server log: printf(const format[], {Float,_}:...)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|format:0x02:Formats string buffer with specifiers: format(output[], len, const format[], ...)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|strlen:0x02:Returns length of string in characters: strlen(const string[])
0x01:item|FUNCTION|strcat:0x02:Concatenates two strings together: strcat(dest[], const source[], maxlength)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|strdel:0x02:Deletes characters from start to end index: strdel(string[], start, end)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|strins:0x02:Inserts string at given index: strins(string[], const substr[], pos, maxlength)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|strcmp:0x02:Compares two strings: strcmp(const string1[], const string2[], bool:ignorecase, length)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|strfind:0x02:Finds substring in target string: strfind(const string[], const sub[], bool:ignorecase, pos)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|strval:0x02:Converts string characters into an integer: strval(const string[])
0x01:item|FUNCTION|valstr:0x02:Converts integer into decimal string: valstr(dest[], value, bool:pack)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|strmid:0x02:Extracts substring from source into dest: strmid(dest[], const source[], start, end, maxlength)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SetTimer:0x02:Calls function after interval in ms: SetTimer(funcname[], interval, repeating)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SetTimerEx:0x02:Calls function with arguments after interval: SetTimerEx(funcname[], interval, repeating, format[], ...)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|KillTimer:0x02:Cancels an active timer: KillTimer(timerid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GetTickCount:0x02:Returns millisecond count since system start: GetTickCount()
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GetMaxPlayers:0x02:Returns configured player slot limit: GetMaxPlayers()
0x01:item|FUNCTION|random:0x02:Returns random integer between 0 and max - 1: random(max)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|min:0x02:Returns smaller of two integer values: min(value1, value2)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|max:0x02:Returns larger of two integer values: max(value1, value2)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|clamp:0x02:Constrains value between min and max bounds: clamp(value, min, max)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SendClientMessage:0x02:Sends chat message to single player: SendClientMessage(playerid, color, const message[])
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SendClientMessageToAll:0x02:Broadcasts chat message to all players: SendClientMessageToAll(color, const message[])
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SendPlayerMessageToPlayer:0x02:Emulates chat from one player to another: SendPlayerMessageToPlayer(playerid, senderid, const message[])
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SendPlayerMessageToAll:0x02:Emulates chat from one player to all: SendPlayerMessageToAll(senderid, const message[])
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SendRconCommand:0x02:Executes an RCON command line directly: SendRconCommand(command[])
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GameTextForAll:0x02:Displays arcade style game text on all screens: GameTextForAll(const string[], time, style)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GameTextForPlayer:0x02:Displays arcade style game text to player: GameTextForPlayer(playerid, const string[], time, style)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SetPlayerSpawnInfo:0x02:Configures default spawn coordinates & gear: SetPlayerSpawnInfo(playerid, team, skin, Float:x, Float:y, Float:z, Float:rotation, ...)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SpawnPlayer:0x02:Forces immediate respawn for player: SpawnPlayer(playerid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SetPlayerPos:0x02:Teleports player to 3D world coordinates: SetPlayerPos(playerid, Float:x, Float:y, Float:z)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SetPlayerPosFindZ:0x02:Teleports player searching for highest ground: SetPlayerPosFindZ(playerid, Float:x, Float:y, Float:z)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GetPlayerPos:0x02:Gets current 3D position of player: GetPlayerPos(playerid, &Float:x, &Float:y, &Float:z)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SetPlayerFacingAngle:0x02:Sets heading compass direction angle: SetPlayerFacingAngle(playerid, Float:ang)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GetPlayerFacingAngle:0x02:Gets heading compass direction angle: GetPlayerFacingAngle(playerid, &Float:ang)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|IsPlayerInRangeOfPoint:0x02:Tests if player is within sphere radius: IsPlayerInRangeOfPoint(playerid, Float:range, Float:x, Float:y, Float:z)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|IsPlayerConnected:0x02:Tests if player is connected: IsPlayerConnected(playerid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|IsPlayerInVehicle:0x02:Tests if player is in specific vehicle: IsPlayerInVehicle(playerid, vehicleid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|IsPlayerInAnyVehicle:0x02:Tests if player is inside any vehicle: IsPlayerInAnyVehicle(playerid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SetPlayerHealth:0x02:Sets current health points: SetPlayerHealth(playerid, Float:health)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GetPlayerHealth:0x02:Gets current health points: GetPlayerHealth(playerid, &Float:health)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SetPlayerArmour:0x02:Sets current body armour points: SetPlayerArmour(playerid, Float:armour)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GetPlayerArmour:0x02:Gets current body armour points: GetPlayerArmour(playerid, &Float:armour)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GivePlayerMoney:0x02:Adds or deducts money from player: GivePlayerMoney(playerid, money)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GetPlayerMoney:0x02:Returns current player money balance: GetPlayerMoney(playerid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|ResetPlayerMoney:0x02:Sets player money balance to zero: ResetPlayerMoney(playerid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SetPlayerScore:0x02:Sets player scoreboard score: SetPlayerScore(playerid, score)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GetPlayerScore:0x02:Returns player scoreboard score: GetPlayerScore(playerid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SetPlayerSkin:0x02:Changes character PED skin ID: SetPlayerSkin(playerid, skinid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GetPlayerSkin:0x02:Returns current character PED skin ID: GetPlayerSkin(playerid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GivePlayerWeapon:0x02:Awards weapon and ammo to player: GivePlayerWeapon(playerid, weaponid, ammo)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|ResetPlayerWeapons:0x02:Removes all weapons from player: ResetPlayerWeapons(playerid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GetPlayerWeapon:0x02:Returns currently held weapon ID: GetPlayerWeapon(playerid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SetPlayerName:0x02:Changes player nickname: SetPlayerName(playerid, const name[])
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GetPlayerName:0x02:Retrieves player nickname: GetPlayerName(playerid, const name[], len)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SetPlayerColor:0x02:Sets player radar blip and name tag color: SetPlayerColor(playerid, color)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GetPlayerColor:0x02:Returns player color: GetPlayerColor(playerid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SetPlayerInterior:0x02:Changes building interior ID: SetPlayerInterior(playerid, interiorid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GetPlayerInterior:0x02:Gets building interior ID: GetPlayerInterior(playerid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SetPlayerVirtualWorld:0x02:Sets virtual world dimension ID: SetPlayerVirtualWorld(playerid, worldid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GetPlayerVirtualWorld:0x02:Gets virtual world dimension ID: GetPlayerVirtualWorld(playerid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GetPlayerIp:0x02:Retrieves player IP address: GetPlayerIp(playerid, const name[], len)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GetPlayerPing:0x02:Returns player latency in ms: GetPlayerPing(playerid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|Kick:0x02:Kicks a player from the server: Kick(playerid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|Ban:0x02:Bans player IP address: Ban(playerid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|BanEx:0x02:Bans player IP address with custom reason: BanEx(playerid, const reason[])
0x01:item|FUNCTION|PutPlayerInVehicle:0x02:Teleports player directly into vehicle: PutPlayerInVehicle(playerid, vehicleid, seatid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|RemovePlayerFromVehicle:0x02:Ejects player from their vehicle: RemovePlayerFromVehicle(playerid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GetPlayerVehicleID:0x02:Returns vehicle ID player is inside: GetPlayerVehicleID(playerid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GetPlayerVehicleSeat:0x02:Returns vehicle seat index of player: GetPlayerVehicleSeat(playerid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|CreateVehicle:0x02:Spawns a new vehicle: CreateVehicle(vehicletype, Float:x, Float:y, Float:z, Float:rotation, color1, color2, respawn_delay, addsiren)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|DestroyVehicle:0x02:Removes vehicle from the server: DestroyVehicle(vehicleid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GetVehiclePos:0x02:Gets 3D position of vehicle: GetVehiclePos(vehicleid, &Float:x, &Float:y, &Float:z)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SetVehiclePos:0x02:Teleports vehicle to coordinates: SetVehiclePos(vehicleid, Float:x, Float:y, Float:z)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|RepairVehicle:0x02:Repairs vehicle engine and body panels: RepairVehicle(vehicleid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|SetVehicleNumberPlate:0x02:Sets license plate text: SetVehicleNumberPlate(vehicleid, const numberplate[])
0x01:item|FUNCTION|GetVehicleModel:0x02:Returns vehicle model ID: GetVehicleModel(vehicleid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|AddVehicleComponent:0x02:Adds car mod component: AddVehicleComponent(vehicleid, componentid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|RemoveVehicleComponent:0x02:Removes car mod component: RemoveVehicleComponent(vehicleid, componentid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|ChangeVehicleColor:0x02:Changes body color of vehicle: ChangeVehicleColor(vehicleid, color1, color2)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|ChangeVehiclePaintjob:0x02:Changes paintjob livery of vehicle: ChangeVehiclePaintjob(vehicleid, paintjobid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|CreateObject:0x02:Creates global world object: CreateObject(modelid, Float:X, Float:Y, Float:Z, Float:rX, Float:rY, Float:rZ, Float:DrawDistance)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|DestroyObject:0x02:Destroys world object: DestroyObject(objectid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|MoveObject:0x02:Smoothly moves object to target position: MoveObject(objectid, Float:X, Float:Y, Float:Z, Float:Speed, Float:RotX, Float:RotY, Float:RotZ)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|StopObject:0x02:Halts object movement immediately: StopObject(objectid)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|CreatePickup:0x02:Creates world pickup model: CreatePickup(model, type, Float:X, Float:Y, Float:Z, Virtualworld)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|DestroyPickup:0x02:Removes pickup: DestroyPickup(pickup)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|ShowPlayerDialog:0x02:Displays modal GUI dialog window to player: ShowPlayerDialog(playerid, dialogid, style, caption[], info[], button1[], button2[])
0x01:item|FUNCTION|TextDrawCreate:0x02:Creates global on-screen text draw: TextDrawCreate(Float:x, Float:y, text[])
0x01:item|FUNCTION|TextDrawDestroy:0x02:Destroys global text draw: TextDrawDestroy(Text:text)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|TextDrawShowForPlayer:0x02:Displays text draw to player: TextDrawShowForPlayer(playerid, Text:text)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|TextDrawHideForPlayer:0x02:Hides text draw from player: TextDrawHideForPlayer(playerid, Text:text)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|TextDrawSetString:0x02:Updates text draw string: TextDrawSetString(Text:text, string[])
0x01:item|FUNCTION|fopen:0x02:Opens file on disk: fopen(name[], mode)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|fclose:0x02:Closes open file handle: fclose(File:handle)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|fwrite:0x02:Writes text line to file: fwrite(File:handle, string[])
0x01:item|FUNCTION|fread:0x02:Reads text line from file: fread(File:handle, string[], size, bool:pack)
0x01:item|FUNCTION|fexist:0x02:Checks if file exists on server disk: fexist(name[])
0x01:item|FUNCTION|fremove:0x02:Deletes file from server disk: fremove(name[])
